---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Tax Calculators & Tools" canonicalPath="/tax-calculators">
<div class="wrap"><div class="page-head" style="padding-top:24px"><div class="eyebrow">Tax tools</div><h1 style="margin-top:8px">Tax calculators & tools</h1><p>Practical tools will be added here with their assumptions, applicable year and source basis shown clearly.</p></div><div class="grid g2">
<div class="card"><span class="tag">Planned</span><h3 style="margin:12px 0 8px">Income-tax calculator</h3><p class="muted">Year-specific calculation with old/new regime logic and a transparent calculation trail.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="tag">Planned</span><h3 style="margin:12px 0 8px">TDS calculator</h3><p class="muted">Section-specific TDS reference and calculation support.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="tag">Planned</span><h3 style="margin:12px 0 8px">Capital gains calculator</h3><p class="muted">Separate short-term/long-term treatment with applicable dates and rates shown.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="tag">Planned</span><h3 style="margin:12px 0 8px">GST calculator</h3><p class="muted">Inclusive/exclusive GST calculations once the GST module is established.</p></div>
</div><div class="card" style="margin-top:20px"><b>Accuracy rule:</b><p class="muted" style="margin:6px 0 0">Calculators will not silently guess a tax year, rate, threshold or exemption. Every calculation will identify the legal assumptions used.</p></div></div>
</Layout>